#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:5
msgid "Define title block extra information"
msgstr "定义图框附加信息"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:8
msgid "Define extra information from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏定义附加信息"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:10
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit extra information** menu item to display `extra "
"information PopUp window`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **编辑 > 编辑附加信息** 菜单项以显示 `附加信息弹出窗口 <extra information PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor Edit Menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:17
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:26
msgid "Introduce the desired information in the text field."
msgstr "在文本字段中输入所需信息。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:18
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:27
msgid "Press **OK** to accept and close `extra information PopUp window`_."
msgstr "按 **确定** 接受并关闭 `附加信息弹出窗口 <extra information PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:21
msgid "Define extra information using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键定义附加信息"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:23
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:25
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + y`` to display the `extra information PopUp window`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + y`` 显示 `附加信息弹出窗口 <extra information PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/define_extra_info.rst:31
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
